1
00:00:02,825 --> 00:00:03,891
We are sorry.

2
00:00:06,688 --> 00:00:07,923
We...

3
00:00:11,905 --> 00:00:13,196
will get married.

4
00:00:26,841 --> 00:00:30,290
(Episode 10)

5
00:00:41,216 --> 00:00:42,481
Thank you.

6
00:00:43,588 --> 00:00:44,960
Drive safely.

7
00:00:48,244 --> 00:00:49,336
Yoon Jun Seo.

8
00:00:55,815 --> 00:00:56,979
That was for Shin Yu Mi.

9
00:01:01,833 --> 00:01:03,053
That was for your parents.

10
00:01:11,031 --> 00:01:12,443
There is nothing for me.

11
00:01:18,550 --> 00:01:19,647
Han Tae Seok.

12
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:27,584
If it had been something I could give up,
I wouldn't have done it.

13
00:01:28,549 --> 00:01:29,992
If it had been something I could give up,

14
00:01:34,772 --> 00:01:36,783
I wouldn't have done it this way.

15
00:01:39,566 --> 00:01:41,407
Eun Seo and I can't be apart.

16
00:01:42,501 --> 00:01:44,616
Even if we hurt all of you,

17
00:01:46,757 --> 00:01:48,567
we can't give up on ourselves.

18
00:01:52,228 --> 00:01:54,136
We can't, Tae Seok.

19
00:02:34,999 --> 00:02:36,674
Mom, I can't help it.

20
00:02:38,304 --> 00:02:39,924
There's nothing I can do about it.

21
00:02:42,712 --> 00:02:45,825
I... Jun Seo...

22
00:02:45,825 --> 00:02:49,057
You can't say that. That's wrong, Eun Seo.

23
00:02:49,057 --> 00:02:50,171
That's wrong.

24
00:02:56,930 --> 00:02:58,027
Eun Seo.

25
00:02:59,641 --> 00:03:00,731
Eun Seo.

26
00:03:03,728 --> 00:03:06,716
I want you to be with them as a family...

27
00:03:08,010 --> 00:03:09,956
and be loved the way
you were loved before.

28
00:03:12,081 --> 00:03:14,484
I want to see you live like that.

29
00:03:17,111 --> 00:03:20,763
That's what you can do for me.

30
00:03:22,391 --> 00:03:25,594
I understand why you love your brother.

31
00:03:26,319 --> 00:03:28,138
But that's not love.

32
00:03:29,295 --> 00:03:33,353
It's just because
you've been apart for a long time.

33
00:03:35,679 --> 00:03:37,057
It's all I want.

34
00:03:38,310 --> 00:03:42,559
This is all I want from you.
Could you do that for me?

35
00:03:44,475 --> 00:03:47,244
I wasn't a great mother to you,

36
00:03:47,244 --> 00:03:51,944
but I'm still your mom.
So please listen to me.

37
00:03:53,179 --> 00:03:56,034
Eun Seo, you have to stop this.

38
00:03:56,629 --> 00:03:58,153
Stop now, Eun Seo.

39
00:04:00,958 --> 00:04:04,179
Stop this, Eun Seo.

40
00:04:39,364 --> 00:04:40,445
Hello.

41
00:04:44,693 --> 00:04:45,744
Is this Eun Seo?

42
00:04:46,477 --> 00:04:48,031
Where are you, Eun Seo?

43
00:05:11,642 --> 00:05:13,308
You don't look good.

44
00:05:14,356 --> 00:05:16,146
What?

45
00:05:17,481 --> 00:05:18,772
It's nothing.

46
00:05:22,369 --> 00:05:23,628
How was it with you?

47
00:05:25,745 --> 00:05:27,018
I was scolded.

48
00:05:28,913 --> 00:05:30,299
How are Mom and Dad?

49
00:05:38,609 --> 00:05:39,875
How is Yu Mi?

50
00:05:49,488 --> 00:05:50,555
We...

51
00:05:57,064 --> 00:05:58,492
You need only think about me.

52
00:06:03,826 --> 00:06:05,356
You needn't worry about anything else.

53
00:06:07,473 --> 00:06:08,473
I won't.

54
00:06:10,528 --> 00:06:11,861
You'll try to be happy.

55
00:06:13,769 --> 00:06:14,769
I will.

56
00:06:20,361 --> 00:06:21,583
But...

57
00:06:23,974 --> 00:06:26,131
Why am I so anxious?

58
00:06:36,870 --> 00:06:39,027
I absolve you from your sins.

59
00:06:44,287 --> 00:06:46,320
I absolve you from your sins.

60
00:06:57,254 --> 00:06:58,945
You're finally here.

61
00:07:02,678 --> 00:07:06,307
You're finally here,
but just for cleaning.

62
00:07:15,877 --> 00:07:18,160
Do I mean that little to you?

63
00:07:19,565 --> 00:07:22,744
I was going to call you.

64
00:07:23,157 --> 00:07:24,157
Were you?

65
00:07:26,469 --> 00:07:28,403
So when?

66
00:07:28,403 --> 00:07:29,623
When were you going to call?

67
00:07:31,698 --> 00:07:33,693
When you and Jun Seo get married?

68
00:07:35,324 --> 00:07:36,324
I'm sorry.

69
00:07:36,714 --> 00:07:37,933
You're not sorry.

70
00:07:39,004 --> 00:07:40,277
You're not someone who would feel sorry.

71
00:07:41,345 --> 00:07:43,413
- I'm sorry.
- Stop saying you're sorry.

72
00:07:45,791 --> 00:07:48,802
What exactly are you sorry for?

73
00:07:50,191 --> 00:07:52,208
Are you sorry for betraying me
and running away?

74
00:07:53,021 --> 00:07:54,183
Or...

75
00:07:55,076 --> 00:07:57,406
are you sorry for using me
when you don't love me?

76
00:07:58,205 --> 00:07:59,488
Or...

77
00:08:01,068 --> 00:08:03,191
are you just saying you're sorry
because you don't know...

78
00:08:05,460 --> 00:08:06,737
how to break up with me?

79
00:08:13,053 --> 00:08:19,282
Haven't you ever loved me,
not even for a little bit?

80
00:08:24,239 --> 00:08:25,865
Not even a little?

81
00:08:31,129 --> 00:08:33,190
No. I have not.

82
00:08:33,190 --> 00:08:35,640
I haven't loved you,
not even for a moment.

83
00:08:40,338 --> 00:08:42,664
I have not loved you.

84
00:08:42,664 --> 00:08:44,120
I have never loved you.

85
00:10:06,025 --> 00:10:07,025
Eun Seo.

86
00:10:08,433 --> 00:10:09,548
Let's meet.

87
00:10:12,544 --> 00:10:13,875
Please come meet me right now.

88
00:10:18,033 --> 00:10:19,339
I love you, Eun Seo.

89
00:10:21,017 --> 00:10:22,434
I love you.

90
00:10:25,169 --> 00:10:26,914
I don't care about anything else.

91
00:10:28,464 --> 00:10:29,518
Just...

92
00:10:32,019 --> 00:10:33,582
let me see you.

93
00:10:40,835 --> 00:10:45,005
How can you do this to me?

94
00:11:06,794 --> 00:11:08,095
Get out, Eun Seo.

95
00:11:10,321 --> 00:11:11,389
Eun Seo.

96
00:11:13,307 --> 00:11:14,869
Please come out.

97
00:11:17,826 --> 00:11:19,645
Please meet with me.

98
00:11:27,099 --> 00:11:30,217
Why are you hurting him?

99
00:11:30,217 --> 00:11:33,141
Why are you hurting so many people?

100
00:12:36,346 --> 00:12:37,444
I'm sorry.

101
00:12:39,410 --> 00:12:41,663
Don't forgive me.

102
00:12:41,663 --> 00:12:43,360
Please don't forgive me.

103
00:13:21,870 --> 00:13:24,424
I came here to pick up my belongings.

104
00:13:25,695 --> 00:13:29,049
My painting tools and everything
I left here,

105
00:13:30,863 --> 00:13:34,734
all the memories with you, and...

106
00:13:34,734 --> 00:13:36,976
my heart that I gave to you,

107
00:13:38,173 --> 00:13:39,730
I'll take everything back.

108
00:13:45,198 --> 00:13:46,198
I'm sorry.

109
00:13:47,821 --> 00:13:48,992
It's okay.

110
00:13:50,325 --> 00:13:53,649
I get it now. I can understand.

111
00:13:55,428 --> 00:13:57,726
I think it's the same.

112
00:13:57,726 --> 00:14:00,540
If what you feel for Eun Seo is...

113
00:14:00,540 --> 00:14:03,224
the same as what I feel for you,

114
00:14:04,877 --> 00:14:06,535
I can understand.

115
00:14:09,934 --> 00:14:13,041
That is why you can't leave her.

116
00:14:14,764 --> 00:14:17,015
If you have that feeling,

117
00:14:18,219 --> 00:14:20,088
you can't help it.

118
00:14:24,223 --> 00:14:25,802
There is no need to be sorry.

119
00:14:32,901 --> 00:14:36,633
I found out you could have this feeling.

120
00:14:38,390 --> 00:14:43,280
I've never imagined
you could have this feeling.

121
00:14:44,533 --> 00:14:45,968
But I was wrong.

122
00:14:49,716 --> 00:14:51,658
Because your feeling isn't meant for me,

123
00:14:51,658 --> 00:14:53,654
it took a long time for me
to accept the fact.

124
00:14:57,747 --> 00:14:59,462
I'll get punished later.

125
00:15:00,049 --> 00:15:02,045
But so be it,

126
00:15:04,282 --> 00:15:06,172
there is no option for me other than this.

127
00:15:09,394 --> 00:15:10,669
I'm sorry, Yu Mi.

128
00:15:12,521 --> 00:15:15,507
You don't need to be sorry.

129
00:15:15,507 --> 00:15:17,293
There's an easy way to put it in words.

130
00:15:18,250 --> 00:15:20,316
I just realized.

131
00:15:27,244 --> 00:15:30,509
We're not meant to be together.

132
00:15:39,442 --> 00:15:41,109
You'll find someone great.

133
00:15:43,833 --> 00:15:47,014
I know. I'm a good person.

134
00:15:48,482 --> 00:15:49,482
Yes.

135
00:15:52,834 --> 00:15:55,262
Can you help me move things?

136
00:16:04,691 --> 00:16:05,796
Drive safely.

137
00:16:07,161 --> 00:16:08,245
Thanks.

138
00:16:18,259 --> 00:16:22,405
Can you give me a hug for the last time?

139
00:16:37,977 --> 00:16:39,635
This is your scent...

140
00:16:42,935 --> 00:16:45,202
and the feeling of being in your arms.

141
00:16:50,194 --> 00:16:51,588
I'll remember it.

142
00:17:04,168 --> 00:17:05,379
Please be happy.

143
00:17:07,752 --> 00:17:08,939
You have to be happy.

144
00:17:48,005 --> 00:17:49,677
This...

145
00:17:49,677 --> 00:17:50,981
What is it?

146
00:17:50,981 --> 00:17:57,292
Mom brought me too much kimchi.

147
00:17:57,292 --> 00:18:01,338
This isn't for Jun Seo,
but for Ji Hwan, right?

148
00:18:01,338 --> 00:18:04,092
No, what are you talking about?

149
00:18:04,092 --> 00:18:05,293
Okay, I will take it.

150
00:18:08,377 --> 00:18:09,901
- Give me a minute
- Okay.

151
00:18:12,524 --> 00:18:13,524
Dad.

152
00:18:15,877 --> 00:18:17,607
Are you here for Sin Ae?

153
00:18:19,757 --> 00:18:20,809
No.

154
00:18:21,973 --> 00:18:25,200
Sin Ae was off today.

155
00:18:26,301 --> 00:18:27,301
Why?

156
00:18:29,789 --> 00:18:31,222
Because your mother...

157
00:18:33,252 --> 00:18:34,341
is sick.

158
00:18:36,132 --> 00:18:37,830
Is she sick?

159
00:18:38,588 --> 00:18:39,781
Is Mom sick?

160
00:18:40,236 --> 00:18:41,637
Does it look bad? Is it okay?

161
00:18:41,637 --> 00:18:43,909
It's good. Do as you want.
It'll be a great piece as it is.

162
00:18:43,909 --> 00:18:45,637
I don't think it looks good.
I will do it again.

163
00:18:45,637 --> 00:18:48,029
That one looks bad.

164
00:18:48,029 --> 00:18:49,173
I will do it again.

165
00:18:49,173 --> 00:18:50,188
You are here.

166
00:18:50,188 --> 00:18:52,550
- Yes, I came to hang out.
- I see.

167
00:18:53,637 --> 00:18:54,967
Where is Eun Seo?

168
00:18:55,797 --> 00:18:58,919
Her father came to the hotel.
Did something happen at home?

169
00:19:11,187 --> 00:19:12,566
You came.

170
00:19:15,659 --> 00:19:17,191
Why are you sick?

171
00:19:19,028 --> 00:19:20,382
Why?

172
00:19:23,124 --> 00:19:24,855
Is it because of Jun Seo and me?

173
00:19:26,347 --> 00:19:27,438
No.

174
00:19:29,828 --> 00:19:31,020
It's not.

175
00:19:33,393 --> 00:19:35,227
It's not because of you.

176
00:19:36,800 --> 00:19:37,859
Mom...

177
00:19:42,912 --> 00:19:43,980
Why would I...

178
00:19:46,160 --> 00:19:48,955
Why would I be sick because of you?

179
00:19:53,010 --> 00:19:54,165
Eun Seo.

180
00:19:55,617 --> 00:19:57,332
It is our fault.

181
00:19:59,042 --> 00:20:03,260
It is our fault. It's on your dad and me.

182
00:20:10,056 --> 00:20:14,141
We made you and Jun Seo part terribly,

183
00:20:17,004 --> 00:20:21,435
so things turned out this way.

184
00:20:23,803 --> 00:20:28,521
You missed each other so much,

185
00:20:28,521 --> 00:20:30,547
so you feel this way now.

186
00:20:40,370 --> 00:20:41,791
I've been thinking.

187
00:20:44,587 --> 00:20:48,524
Why don't you study more?

188
00:20:51,267 --> 00:20:53,171
In the U.S. or in Europe...

189
00:20:53,171 --> 00:20:55,774
I want to send you anywhere you want.

190
00:21:01,115 --> 00:21:02,639
Let's go together.

191
00:21:04,891 --> 00:21:06,182
I am sorry.

192
00:21:07,122 --> 00:21:08,295
Eun Seo.

193
00:21:11,813 --> 00:21:12,957
Eun Seo.

194
00:21:15,060 --> 00:21:16,142
Yes.

195
00:21:18,579 --> 00:21:22,064
Your mother and I have never...

196
00:21:23,803 --> 00:21:26,173
had a day going by
without thinking of you.

197
00:21:28,674 --> 00:21:32,106
We are sorry.

198
00:21:34,120 --> 00:21:37,074
Don't be, Dad.

199
00:21:40,256 --> 00:21:44,664
Whether biologically related or not,
you're my daughter.

200
00:21:49,143 --> 00:21:53,410
I've never forgotten that.

201
00:21:55,830 --> 00:22:00,591
I was always grateful
that you and Jun Seo...

202
00:22:04,078 --> 00:22:07,297
got along with each other
without a single argument.

203
00:22:08,182 --> 00:22:10,159
But now, you and Jun Seo are...

204
00:22:10,893 --> 00:22:13,975
I am sorry.

205
00:22:18,726 --> 00:22:21,023
Let's go to the U.S.

206
00:22:23,118 --> 00:22:27,371
Three of us go together, and...

207
00:22:27,371 --> 00:22:30,036
you'll meet a good man and get married.

208
00:22:30,482 --> 00:22:31,980
She will marry me.

209
00:22:37,410 --> 00:22:38,758
She's getting married to me.

210
00:22:40,643 --> 00:22:42,598
If she goes to the U.S.,
she'll go there with me.

211
00:22:44,242 --> 00:22:46,099
Eun Seo will stay with me from now on.

212
00:22:46,099 --> 00:22:47,127
You...

213
00:22:49,428 --> 00:22:51,318
You are siblings.

214
00:22:52,299 --> 00:22:55,015
There is no way
a sister can get married to her brother.

215
00:22:55,015 --> 00:22:57,675
When I told you
Eun Seo was my only sister,

216
00:22:57,675 --> 00:22:58,934
you told me she wasn't.

217
00:23:01,035 --> 00:23:02,651
You said she wasn't my sister anymore.

218
00:23:02,651 --> 00:23:05,107
Then why are you telling me
I can't love her?

219
00:23:05,107 --> 00:23:07,410
You left her here for ten years
because she wasn't my sister.

220
00:23:07,410 --> 00:23:08,540
You...

221
00:23:08,540 --> 00:23:09,540
Dad.

222
00:23:10,749 --> 00:23:12,779
We're not siblings.

223
00:23:12,779 --> 00:23:14,829
We're not related,

224
00:23:17,477 --> 00:23:19,455
and we're in love.

225
00:23:22,722 --> 00:23:24,814
So, what is the matter?

226
00:23:25,675 --> 00:23:26,695
What is?

227
00:23:28,107 --> 00:23:30,966
We're getting married
with or without your permission.

228
00:23:31,818 --> 00:23:33,282
You...

229
00:23:33,282 --> 00:23:34,362
Dad.

230
00:23:34,362 --> 00:23:35,477
Jun Seo.

231
00:23:36,761 --> 00:23:39,947
You're not my son anymore.

232
00:23:39,947 --> 00:23:41,892
You're not my son.

233
00:23:43,362 --> 00:23:45,557
Even if you cut me off,
it won't change anything.

234
00:23:47,033 --> 00:23:48,364
We're getting married.

235
00:23:51,961 --> 00:23:53,707
I won't leave her...

236
00:23:55,314 --> 00:23:57,292
as I was forced to do before.

237
00:24:13,726 --> 00:24:16,906
Everything is a mess, isn't it?

238
00:24:18,399 --> 00:24:19,547
It's not.

239
00:24:21,424 --> 00:24:22,618
What is a mess?

240
00:24:26,887 --> 00:24:29,018
You had an argument with Dad,

241
00:24:30,423 --> 00:24:31,801
and Mom is sick.

242
00:24:34,295 --> 00:24:35,921
You and I...

243
00:24:37,023 --> 00:24:40,741
hurt Yu Mi and Tae Seok.

244
00:24:40,741 --> 00:24:42,807
Eun Seo, think about it this way.

245
00:24:44,117 --> 00:24:45,597
We have been through everything.

246
00:24:45,597 --> 00:24:48,995
We've dealt with everything we had to,

247
00:24:48,995 --> 00:24:51,926
and now we have only each other.

248
00:24:53,172 --> 00:24:54,172
No.

249
00:24:55,316 --> 00:24:57,014
We did wrong.

250
00:24:59,739 --> 00:25:03,103
We shouldn't have done it,
although we forgive ourselves.

251
00:25:03,523 --> 00:25:04,583
Stop.

252
00:25:05,259 --> 00:25:09,181
What should we do now?

253
00:25:12,076 --> 00:25:13,862
It's all my fault.

254
00:25:14,659 --> 00:25:16,494
It's all because of me.

255
00:25:20,067 --> 00:25:24,933
If you hadn't met me...

256
00:25:27,620 --> 00:25:30,566
If I hadn't met Mom and Dad,

257
00:25:32,203 --> 00:25:34,502
all of us would have been happy.

258
00:25:35,228 --> 00:25:36,710
Don't make me get upset.

259
00:25:40,162 --> 00:25:45,815
If you hadn't loved me...

260
00:25:51,684 --> 00:25:54,133
I was so happy to meet you.

261
00:25:59,571 --> 00:26:00,861
I've never thought of...

262
00:26:02,267 --> 00:26:03,972
being happy without you.

263
00:26:10,354 --> 00:26:11,421
Me, neither.

264
00:26:12,722 --> 00:26:13,757
I haven't...

265
00:26:16,052 --> 00:26:18,254
I haven't thought of that, either.

266
00:26:28,351 --> 00:26:29,351
Give me that.

267
00:26:29,928 --> 00:26:31,649
How can you be worse than me?

268
00:26:33,031 --> 00:26:35,089
- Like this.
- Give it to me.

269
00:26:41,231 --> 00:26:44,971
How about going to the farm this weekend?

270
00:26:47,520 --> 00:26:48,882
Are you suggesting we run away again?

271
00:26:55,256 --> 00:26:57,050
There's no one to stop us anymore.

272
00:26:59,455 --> 00:27:00,455
I just...

273
00:27:02,503 --> 00:27:04,033
I wished we could stay longer last time.

274
00:27:09,256 --> 00:27:10,256
Eun Seo.

275
00:27:15,592 --> 00:27:16,858
Why don't we live there?

276
00:27:23,047 --> 00:27:24,047
What is it?

277
00:27:25,671 --> 00:27:27,754
It's nothing.

278
00:27:31,230 --> 00:27:34,922
Will you go to the farm with me?

279
00:27:40,179 --> 00:27:41,179
Yes.

280
00:27:42,264 --> 00:27:43,264
I promise.

281
00:28:01,729 --> 00:28:02,878
Hello.

282
00:28:08,538 --> 00:28:09,683
Is this Yu Mi's mother?

283
00:28:12,769 --> 00:28:13,769
Yes.

284
00:28:18,666 --> 00:28:19,666
What did you say?

285
00:28:34,218 --> 00:28:35,218
Ma'am.

286
00:28:40,665 --> 00:28:42,523
You are bad.

287
00:28:42,523 --> 00:28:46,560
You are bad and mean.

288
00:28:46,560 --> 00:28:48,536
Is she alive?

289
00:28:48,536 --> 00:28:50,091
Is she still alive?

290
00:28:55,784 --> 00:28:56,890
Ma'am.

291
00:29:08,536 --> 00:29:10,089
Who is Shin Yu Mi's family?

292
00:29:14,255 --> 00:29:18,040
Is she okay?
Is my daughter going to be okay?

293
00:29:18,040 --> 00:29:19,192
Yes.

294
00:29:19,192 --> 00:29:20,976
She will be fine,

295
00:29:20,976 --> 00:29:23,146
but she is very weak
since she was in shock.

296
00:29:27,112 --> 00:29:31,777
Also, her right arm
would be fine for daily use,

297
00:29:31,777 --> 00:29:33,066
but there's a chance that...

298
00:29:34,232 --> 00:29:36,407
No, no way.

299
00:29:36,407 --> 00:29:39,279
My daughter is a painter.

300
00:29:39,279 --> 00:29:41,939
This can't be happening. Doctor sir, no.

301
00:29:41,939 --> 00:29:43,523
Can I see her now?

302
00:29:43,523 --> 00:29:44,879
Can I meet her?

303
00:29:45,909 --> 00:29:47,628
How dare you see her?

304
00:29:47,628 --> 00:29:49,094
Whom do you want to meet?

305
00:29:49,507 --> 00:29:50,659
Ma'am.

306
00:29:50,659 --> 00:29:52,235
Who made her like that?

307
00:29:52,235 --> 00:29:54,116
Whose fault is this?

308
00:29:54,116 --> 00:29:55,793
Whose fault?

309
00:29:55,793 --> 00:29:58,327
Whose...

310
00:30:24,479 --> 00:30:25,881
(Emergency)

311
00:30:26,846 --> 00:30:30,007
Excuse me. Which room is Shin Yu Mi in?

312
00:30:30,007 --> 00:30:31,760
Her family doesn't want any visitors.

313
00:30:52,691 --> 00:30:54,343
Please let me see her just for a moment.

314
00:31:33,373 --> 00:31:35,582
- Your room looks great.
- Yes.

315
00:31:35,582 --> 00:31:37,357
Is this a kitchen?

316
00:31:37,357 --> 00:31:38,578
Yes, go ahead.

317
00:31:45,652 --> 00:31:47,859
You are lucky to be the son of the CEO.

318
00:31:48,601 --> 00:31:50,089
The bedroom is upstairs.
You can look around.

319
00:31:50,089 --> 00:31:51,089
Okay.

320
00:32:03,457 --> 00:32:04,474
Tae Seok.

321
00:32:06,609 --> 00:32:07,625
Tae Seok?

322
00:32:09,496 --> 00:32:11,211
You have quite a few men you call by name,
don't you?

323
00:32:13,240 --> 00:32:15,039
It's fine, Choi Eun Seo.

324
00:32:15,039 --> 00:32:17,070
You can live the way you live.

325
00:32:17,070 --> 00:32:20,522
I'll live the way I do.

326
00:32:22,815 --> 00:32:25,860
I'm so sorry.

327
00:32:25,860 --> 00:32:26,870
You're sorry?

328
00:32:28,683 --> 00:32:30,234
But there's nothing I can do for you.

329
00:32:30,234 --> 00:32:32,467
I don't accept apologies.

330
00:32:32,467 --> 00:32:36,634
Rather, I might get back at you,

331
00:32:38,239 --> 00:32:40,498
so stay out of my sight.

332
00:32:42,144 --> 00:32:43,379
Tae Seok.

333
00:32:44,015 --> 00:32:45,451
Yes, I'm coming.

334
00:32:49,479 --> 00:32:52,795
I will leave now, sir.

335
00:32:57,200 --> 00:32:58,337
Tae Seok!

336
00:32:58,848 --> 00:33:00,420
Okay, I said I'm coming.

337
00:33:39,783 --> 00:33:40,783
Yu Mi.

338
00:33:41,766 --> 00:33:42,769
Are you all right?

339
00:33:45,052 --> 00:33:47,360
You were worried.

340
00:33:53,140 --> 00:33:54,656
You were worried about me.

341
00:33:58,837 --> 00:34:00,025
I am sorry.

342
00:34:01,166 --> 00:34:03,416
I didn't intend to make you worried.

343
00:34:08,398 --> 00:34:10,393
I have no luck with anything.

344
00:34:14,332 --> 00:34:15,912
Why did you do that?

345
00:34:17,117 --> 00:34:18,117
I just...

346
00:34:33,110 --> 00:34:34,655
- I'm sorry.
- I am sorry.

347
00:34:44,503 --> 00:34:46,777
I wanted to go there.

348
00:34:50,079 --> 00:34:53,235
The beach where you drew me
for the first time.

349
00:34:55,318 --> 00:34:57,033
If I go there,

350
00:34:58,006 --> 00:35:02,218
I feel like you'd be there
just like you were at that time.

351
00:35:04,007 --> 00:35:05,393
I wanted to go.

352
00:35:07,846 --> 00:35:08,846
I'm sorry.

353
00:35:11,901 --> 00:35:13,208
What can I do?

354
00:35:16,814 --> 00:35:18,488
What would you have me do?

355
00:35:20,160 --> 00:35:22,081
What can you do for me?

356
00:35:23,198 --> 00:35:24,904
What can you do?

357
00:35:26,597 --> 00:35:30,623
I'm not sure if I can go back
to my normal life.

358
00:35:30,623 --> 00:35:31,946
I can't even work.

359
00:35:33,447 --> 00:35:35,360
What can you do for me?

360
00:35:39,358 --> 00:35:40,376
I'm sorry.

361
00:35:49,405 --> 00:35:50,552
I am sorry.

362
00:35:54,071 --> 00:35:56,901
I'll be fine, so go. Just go.

363
00:35:58,450 --> 00:36:00,563
I won't bother you.

364
00:36:01,554 --> 00:36:04,523
Please don't care about me and,

365
00:36:05,735 --> 00:36:08,594
be happy with Eun Seo.

366
00:36:10,863 --> 00:36:14,268
I'm sick of everything.

367
00:36:17,160 --> 00:36:19,466
I'm not going to see you again.

368
00:36:20,177 --> 00:36:24,097
I feel terrible for you
to see me like this.

369
00:36:25,823 --> 00:36:27,292
Do not come back.

370
00:36:36,056 --> 00:36:37,250
I will come back tomorrow.

371
00:37:06,299 --> 00:37:08,781
Did you meet Yu Mi?

372
00:37:18,412 --> 00:37:19,698
Eun Seo.

373
00:37:19,698 --> 00:37:22,964
I see.

374
00:37:27,082 --> 00:37:28,493
Is she all right?

375
00:37:29,601 --> 00:37:30,909
Is she in pain?

376
00:37:36,082 --> 00:37:37,116
She's fine.

377
00:37:38,762 --> 00:37:41,916
That's good. I'm relieved.

378
00:37:45,930 --> 00:37:50,342
But she's probably depressed,

379
00:37:53,265 --> 00:37:55,180
because she can't paint anymore.

380
00:38:00,833 --> 00:38:01,972
Jun Seo.

381
00:38:04,563 --> 00:38:05,701
Yes?

382
00:38:07,514 --> 00:38:13,548
Do you remember our plan
for going to the farm tomorrow?

383
00:38:25,713 --> 00:38:26,911
I do.

384
00:38:31,659 --> 00:38:35,205
We can't go, can we?

385
00:38:42,818 --> 00:38:44,068
That's disappointing.

386
00:38:48,650 --> 00:38:49,787
You're sorry, aren't you?

387
00:38:55,882 --> 00:38:58,090
It's all right if you can't go.

388
00:38:58,090 --> 00:39:00,604
I'm telling you this in case you feel bad.

389
00:39:03,179 --> 00:39:04,740
I should get going.

390
00:39:06,578 --> 00:39:08,162
I made you dinner.

391
00:39:08,162 --> 00:39:09,837
Don't forget to eat.

392
00:39:13,738 --> 00:39:14,811
Eun Seo.

393
00:39:18,226 --> 00:39:20,820
Let's go. We'll go tomorrow.

394
00:39:21,729 --> 00:39:24,110
I don't want to apologize to you.

395
00:39:26,058 --> 00:39:30,193
We keep apologizing to everyone.

396
00:39:30,193 --> 00:39:31,742
I don't want to apologize to you,
at least.

397
00:39:36,090 --> 00:39:37,413
We'll go there tomorrow.

398
00:39:38,970 --> 00:39:39,970
All right?

399
00:39:44,179 --> 00:39:45,248
We'll go.

400
00:39:47,614 --> 00:39:48,777
We'll go there.

401
00:40:12,341 --> 00:40:13,382
Yes, hello.

402
00:40:13,382 --> 00:40:16,452
Jun Seo, Yu Mi is not here.

403
00:40:16,452 --> 00:40:18,137
- She is gone.
- What?

404
00:40:21,703 --> 00:40:22,915
Ma'am.

405
00:40:22,915 --> 00:40:23,983
Jun Seo.

406
00:40:24,683 --> 00:40:26,219
What should we do?

407
00:40:26,219 --> 00:40:29,575
Where did she go?

408
00:40:30,323 --> 00:40:31,790
Where did she go?

409
00:40:34,596 --> 00:40:36,735
I wanted to go there.

410
00:40:38,324 --> 00:40:41,479
The beach where you drew me
for the first time.

411
00:42:09,259 --> 00:42:10,279
Yu Mi.

412
00:42:18,436 --> 00:42:19,436
Yu Mi.

413
00:42:22,532 --> 00:42:23,815
- Let me go!
- Yu Mi!

414
00:42:23,815 --> 00:42:25,670
- Don't do this.
- Please don't!

415
00:42:25,670 --> 00:42:28,588
- Don't do this.
- Let me go!

416
00:42:28,588 --> 00:42:29,708
Don't do this to me!

417
00:42:30,841 --> 00:42:32,157
Don't leave me!

418
00:42:33,346 --> 00:42:35,946
Don't leave me! I'll kill myself!

419
00:42:36,960 --> 00:42:39,460
Promise me you won't leave me!

420
00:42:40,456 --> 00:42:41,868
Don't leave me!

421
00:42:47,490 --> 00:42:49,131
Don't leave me!

422
00:44:41,266 --> 00:44:45,202
Why are you not answering, Eun Seo?

423
00:44:45,202 --> 00:44:48,156
Please call me back, okay?

424
00:45:01,321 --> 00:45:02,586
Jun Seo.

425
00:45:09,601 --> 00:45:12,868
I was scared that you had gone.

426
00:45:17,384 --> 00:45:19,243
Go back to sleep.

427
00:45:23,848 --> 00:45:25,628
Will you stay?

428
00:45:32,400 --> 00:45:35,589
I don't care if you think I'm pathetic.

429
00:45:35,589 --> 00:45:36,776
Please stay.

430
00:45:38,789 --> 00:45:40,494
Please don't leave me.

431
00:45:54,356 --> 00:45:55,356
I won't.

432
00:45:57,819 --> 00:45:59,192
I won't leave you.

433
00:46:03,542 --> 00:46:05,366
I won't go anywhere.

434
00:46:14,463 --> 00:46:15,571
Eun Seo.

435
00:46:16,792 --> 00:46:18,394
I don't think I can make it.

436
00:46:20,239 --> 00:46:21,307
I can't come.

437
00:46:23,671 --> 00:46:24,897
So, don't wait for me.

438
00:46:29,360 --> 00:46:30,850
I'm so sorry.

439
00:47:04,831 --> 00:47:06,578
Are you sure you want to stay here?

440
00:47:07,903 --> 00:47:09,130
Do you like it here?

441
00:47:11,270 --> 00:47:12,969
Yes, Jun Seo.

442
00:47:17,935 --> 00:47:21,105
I have a favor to ask you.

443
00:47:38,070 --> 00:47:39,250
Hello.

444
00:47:44,208 --> 00:47:45,393
Jun Seo.

445
00:47:57,912 --> 00:48:00,314
I look terrible.

446
00:48:03,455 --> 00:48:04,769
This...

447
00:48:07,503 --> 00:48:09,178
might be the last time.

448
00:48:15,006 --> 00:48:17,648
Does she want to meet me?

449
00:48:20,010 --> 00:48:21,010
Yes.

450
00:48:35,801 --> 00:48:37,886
I am sorry, Eun Seo.

451
00:48:40,434 --> 00:48:44,243
I am so sorry, Eun Seo.

452
00:48:46,817 --> 00:48:50,322
I didn't mean it, but...

453
00:48:51,271 --> 00:48:52,354
It is okay.

454
00:48:52,999 --> 00:48:54,254
But...

455
00:48:55,978 --> 00:49:00,204
I don't think I can live without Jun Seo.

456
00:49:02,546 --> 00:49:04,722
Even if I lose everything...

457
00:49:06,393 --> 00:49:07,603
Even if...

458
00:49:08,242 --> 00:49:09,768
Get well soon, Yu Mi.

459
00:49:10,871 --> 00:49:15,616
Jun Seo will never leave you.

460
00:49:18,230 --> 00:49:21,056
I am sorry for everything.

461
00:49:21,056 --> 00:49:22,570
I am sorry.

462
00:49:47,579 --> 00:49:49,509
Jun Seo, I'm leaving.

463
00:49:50,706 --> 00:49:51,766
Eun Seo.

464
00:50:01,642 --> 00:50:02,642
Jun Seo.

465
00:50:09,155 --> 00:50:10,293
I'm sorry.

466
00:50:12,619 --> 00:50:16,266
You told me you didn't want to
say sorry to me.

467
00:50:16,266 --> 00:50:17,646
But you say that so often.

468
00:50:26,196 --> 00:50:28,365
Make Yu Mi happy.

469
00:50:29,929 --> 00:50:30,966
Eun Seo.

470
00:50:33,026 --> 00:50:36,629
Then, I will be happy.

471
00:50:44,131 --> 00:50:45,158
All right, then.

472
00:50:50,096 --> 00:50:51,186
Eun Seo.

473
00:50:54,888 --> 00:50:56,915
If I were to hold your hand,

474
00:51:00,801 --> 00:51:02,898
I won't be able to let go of it.

475
00:51:12,904 --> 00:51:14,890
I absolve you from your sins.

476
00:51:23,514 --> 00:51:24,971
Jun Seo, good bye.

477
00:51:35,592 --> 00:51:36,715
Good bye.
